Beret: the keys
===============

  Cursor keys, or W A S D     walk, jump (up), duck (down)
  Space                       jump
  Shift                       walk slowly
  Left mouse button (hold)    telekinesis: pick up and move things
  Right mouse button, or G    the telekinesis range guide
  P                           pause
  M                           the camera follows the mouse, or not
  I J K L                     look around the room
  R                           start the room again
  F1 or 1                     save the room's state; F4 or 4 loads it
  Esc                         the menu, and back to the map
  /                           music on or off
  Alt + Return                a screen of its own, or the window

In the game select: Return starts the game picked with the cursor keys.
Options, saves and the rooms you make in the editor are kept in the
drawer's User drawer.
